    "chunk_text": ", Hw\u00e6t is se gewuldroda kyning; Hit is se wuldorf\u00e6sta, se \u00fee God fore wyrc\u00f0 swylc wundru. To \u00fee ic h\u00e6bbe, Drihten, min mod and mine sawle; Drihten, min God, to \u00fee ic hopige, and ic \u00fe\u00e6s Ne mine fynd me n\u00e6fre for\u00f0y ne bysmrian; ne nan \u00fe\u00e6ra, \u00fee to \u00fee hopa\u00f0, ne wyr\u00f0 gescended. Scamien heora ealle \u00fea unrihtwisan, \u00fee idelnesse wyrca\u00f0: Drihten, gedo me \u00feine wegas cu\u00f0e, and l\u00e6r Ger\u00e6d me, and gerece on \u00feinre so\u00f0f\u00e6stnesse, and l\u00e6r me, for \u00feam \u00feu eart Drihten min H\u00e6lend; \u00e6lce Gemun, Drihten, \u00feinra miltsunga, and \u00feinre mildheortnesse, \u00fee fram fruman worlde w\u00e6s. \u00dea scylda mines iugo\u00f0hades ne gemun \u00feu, Drihten, ne huru \u00fea \u00fee ic ungewisses geworhte; \u00fe\u00e6t synt, For \u00feam gesette God \u00e6 scyldiendum on heora wegum, and geriht \u00fea man\u00f0w\u00e6ran on domum, and him For \u00feinre godnesse, Drihten, \u00feu eart swete, and wynsum, and eac rihtwis; Ealle Godes wegas syndon Drihten, for \u00feinum naman beo \u00feu forgifende mina synna, for \u00fey hi synt swy\u00f0e mycele. Hwa hwylc mann swa Drihten ondr\u00e6t, he him geset \u00fea \u00e6, and him syl\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t ge\u00feeaht on \u00feone weg, \u00fee His sawl hi gerest softe on monegum goodum, and his s\u00e6d on ece yrfeweardnesse gesit eor\u00f0an. Drihten is m\u00e6gen and cr\u00e6ftig \u00e6lces \u00fe\u00e6",
